---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="About UNIPRA | University Practice SHS" description="Learn about the history, identity, motto and community of University Practice Senior High School in Cape Coast.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="About the school" title="A story shaped by education and service." description="Discover the origins, values and community behind University Practice Senior High School." />
  <section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow"><span></span> Our beginnings</span><h2 class="page-heading">A practice school with a lasting purpose.</h2><div class="prose"><p>University Practice Senior High School was conceived by the then Faculty of Education of the University of Cape Coast as a practice school where student teachers could gain teaching experience. The Ghana Education Service accepted the idea, with the University providing physical structures and equipment and the Service providing teaching and non-teaching staff.</p><p>The school was formally opened on 13 October 1976. Published school history records an initial cohort of 112 students: 70 students in the A-Level programme and 42 in Lower Sixth, studying General Arts and Science.</p><p>That beginning established a distinctive link between education, professional practice and community. The school's story continues through successive generations of learners, educators, families and old students.</p></div><p class="content-note">Historical details on this page are drawn from the school's earlier published website. They should be reviewed and formally confirmed by school management before this site is launched as the official source.</p></div><div class="history-visual"><div class="history-visual__circle"><span>UNIPRA</span><strong>1976</strong><small>THE JOURNEY CONTINUES</small></div><div class="history-visual__caption">Service to the Community</div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section--wash"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading section-heading--center"><span class="eyebrow"><span></span> Our identity</span><h2>Guided by service.</h2><p>The school's motto expresses a commitment that reaches beyond the classroom: learning should prepare people to contribute to others.</p></div><div class="identity-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Learning</h3><p>Encouraging a lifelong commitment to knowledge, inquiry and personal growth.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Character</h3><p>Promoting responsibility, integrity, discipline and respect within the school community.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Service</h3><p>Using knowledge and opportunity to make a positive contribution to society.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="cta-band"><div class="cta-band__copy"><h2>Be part of the UNIPRA story.</h2><p>Explore school life, learn about the academic experience and stay connected with the wider community.</p></div><a class="button button--light" href="/contact/">Contact the school <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
.page-heading{font:800 clamp(2rem,3.8vw,3.2rem)/1.12 Manrope;letter-spacing:-.06em;color:var(--navy);margin:15px 0 20px}.content-note{background:#fff8e8;border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding:13px 15px;color:#76633f;font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.6;border-radius:0 9px 9px 0;margin-top:22px}.history-visual{height:430px;border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#d9e9df,#eff5ee 55%,#9dc6ad);display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.history-visual:before,.history-visual:after{content:'';position:absolute;border:1px solid #ffffffb0;border-radius:50%;width:340px;height:340px}.history-visual:after{width:430px;height:430px}.history-visual__circle{width:210px;height:230px;background:#0b6847;border:8px solid #f3f1e5;box-shadow:0 15px 40px #0c533b35;border-radius:48% 48% 43% 43%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;color:white;z-index:1}.history-visual__circle span{font:800 1rem Manrope;letter-spacing:.18em}.history-visual__circle strong{font:800 3.8rem Manrope;color:#a5e3bd;letter-spacing:-.06em}.history-visual__circle small{font-size:.5rem;letter-spacing:.18em}.history-visual__caption{position:absolute;bottom:25px;left:25px;color:#0a5c40;font:italic 700 1rem Manrope}.identity-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:17px}.identity-grid article{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;padding:25px}.identity-grid article>span{font:800 1.8rem Manrope;color:#a2cbb1}.identity-grid h3{font:800 1.15rem Manrope;color:var(--navy);margin:15px 0 8px}.identity-grid p{font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin:0}@media(max-width:900px){.identity-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:620px){.history-visual{height:315px}.identity-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
